{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">2008 AMC 10A #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/a/ffaa7410f677476db8464795375c58568631dcf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> bananas are worth as much as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> oranges. How many oranges are worth as much as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/218c6b3e76211f744168e77b8ad9822ccce27d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bananas?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/714e9cdeb4c26a6ed65e191957250944f0d50db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{7}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"350\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7779f7bd5b50960de939d58015526762c66a2df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot10\\ \\text{bananas}=8\\ \\text{oranges}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"202\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d30e156767bc3e82a245b7078f4000a25454676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot5\\ \\text{bananas}=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 5\\ \\text{bananas}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\frac{8\\ \\text{oranges}}{\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot10\\ \\text{bananas}}\\right)=3\\ \\text{oranges}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"558\" height=\"45\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl